{"kp_id": "jgy-017.kp0003", "video_id": "jgy-017", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "衄血止后若目睛金晕黄（眼白仍黄）示未愈，因肝不藏血、木克土；黄退方为真愈。", "entity_ids": ["symptom.nv", "zangfu.gan"], "chapter_id": "jgy-017.c01", "evidence_quote": "流鼻血", "seg_from": 20, "seg_to": 20, "start_s": 125.52, "end_s": 129.455, "citation": {"youtube_id": "mABsoFItvwo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mABsoFItvwo&t=125s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 16驚悸吐衄下血胸滿瘀血病", "start_s": 125.52, "end_s": 129.46}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "目金晕黄/阴黄=目睛黄晕", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-017.kp0004", "video_id": "jgy-017", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "面无血色、无寒热而脉沉弦，见衄、下血或吐血：血离经；阳不固阴则阴外溢。阿司匹林等耗阳使血管失弹性易出血。", "entity_ids": ["symptom.tu_xie", "symptom.nv", "symptom.xia_xue", "concept.yang_xu"], "chapter_id": "jgy-017.c01", "evidence_quote": "吐血", "seg_from": 57, "seg_to": 57, "start_s": 312.08, "end_s": 319.12, "citation": {"youtube_id": "mABsoFItvwo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mABsoFItvwo&t=312s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 16驚悸吐衄下血胸滿瘀血病", "start_s": 312.08, "end_s": 319.12}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "沉玄=沉弦", "source": "llm_read"}
